{"data": [{"article": {"title": "Walmart Opened Its Store to AI Agents. Amazon Blocked Them."}, "author_id": "2069660450929913856", "created_at": "2026-10-23T12:08:38.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113603503323296150"], "id": "2113603503323296150", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Amazon blocks AI shopping agents.\n\nWalmart just built them a front door: an MCP server, plus a profile for every agent with spending caps and approvals.\n\nWhat it means for your brand before Black Friday 👇\n\n#AIAgents #Walmart https://t.co/eCct7VDScq", "url": "https://x.com/umerdarazkha/status/2113603503323296150"}, {"article": {"title": "Meta「Muse」完全ガイド"}, "author_id": "1984808728206721024", "created_at": "2026-10-23T08:39:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113550962212163947"], "id": "2113550962212163947", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3557, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/bIDeCBh5kr", "url": "https://x.com/masato_ai_log/status/2113550962212163947"}, {"author_id": "2037978275591438336", "created_at": "2026-10-23T08:15:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113544777253990524"], "id": "2113544777253990524", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Yesterday Argus transcribed a 25-minute breakdown of Meta Muse matching buyers and sellers across Facebook groups and Marketplace. The useful bit was not automated introductions. It was turning scattered posts into a compounding supply database.", "url": "https://x.com/hedgeonai/status/2113544777253990524"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113536231933874176"]}, "author_id": "2018632049419030529", "created_at": "2026-10-23T07:47:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113537718940799288"], "id": "2113537718940799288", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 49, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anyone tried Paperclip to allow any subset of ChatGPT Work, Grok Bots, Meta Muse, Claude, and/or Hermes to form a C-Suite or run operations? Thoughts? https://t.co/14wMInbvsf", "url": "https://x.com/AutomateDavid/status/2113537718940799288"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-10-23T05:49:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113507966619910400"], "id": "2113507966619910400", "in_reply_to_user_id": "16536267", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113507812928282707", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@RajSaraf @ConnorTalksAI For an average person, Meta Muse is the more practical pick right now. Free tier, built for everyday errands, bookings, shopping, and phone/WhatsApp use with strong privacy controls. Grok Bot is more capable for complex multi-step work and parallel agents, but requires a paid", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2113507966619910400"}, {"article": {"title": "ForwardPass: Paranoid Android"}, "author_id": "2110726916131155969", "created_at": "2026-10-23T05:46:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113507434191094198"], "id": "2113507434191094198", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 26, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/Mb5KGkow9x", "url": "https://x.com/ForwardPassTech/status/2113507434191094198"}, {"article": {"title": "MetaのAIエージェント「Muse」完全ガイド｜使い方10例・ChatGPT／Gemini／Claudeとの違い【初心者向け】"}, "author_id": "1455908690817536009", "created_at": "2026-10-23T05:14:36.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113499308003930277"], "id": "2113499308003930277", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 2391, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "早速MUSEを使ってみたので、\nできることと注意点をまとめました。\n\nMeta社のAIエージェントなので、インスタやスレッズの分析などは得意なのか？\n最初の設定ではAIモデルの学習モードがオンになっているので注意が必要です。\nその他、注意点や気になることもまとめています。 https://t.co/6H17QHnUEx", "url": "https://x.com/kenji_aisupport/status/2113499308003930277"}, {"article": {"title": "#01-先给 AI 配一台电脑：Meta、Google、OpenAI、xAI 的个人智能体"}, "author_id": "1745332167218196480", "created_at": "2026-10-23T04:42:40.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113491273239920847"], "id": "2113491273239920847", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 801, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/MHdAVoLJrg", "url": "https://x.com/sujingshen/status/2113491273239920847"}, {"author_id": "1519152705150885890", "created_at": "2026-10-23T03:25:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113471816299688021"], "id": "2113471816299688021", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 23, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "So I tried uncensored Meta Muse Glimmer 30b, the second thing my agent tried to do was cheat on my benchmark test by trying to go online and copy a better solution from another AI. I think if I use it agentically I will have to be very careful. I'm not big in dense models anyway.", "url": "https://x.com/bad_latency/status/2113471816299688021"}, {"article": {"title": "日本上陸 Meta Muse完全解説"}, "author_id": "2048636572267139072", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:18:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113454889552826421"], "id": "2113454889552826421", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 124, "impression_count": 38409, "like_count": 90, "quote_count": 7, "reply_count": 10, "retweet_count": 13}, "text": "MetaのAIエージェント「Muse」が日本上陸した。\n\n日本で今日できること・まだのこと、最初の設定、Museにそのまま貼れる依頼文6本まで、記事に全部まとめた。\n\n#Muse #MetaMuse #AIエージェント https://t.co/kyLWQXwEPn", "url": "https://x.com/lucky_note_lab/status/2113454889552826421"}, {"author_id": "16414674", "created_at": "2026-10-23T02:03:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113451214645932336"], "id": "2113451214645932336", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 274, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Claude Duet, OpenAI Dots, Meta Muse. Every lab now has an always-on agent.\n\nSame demo every time: morning brief, inbox triage, \"it booked my flight.\"\n\nI've been living with Dots for weeks. The killer use case isn't errands. It found a class action on my home purchase I'd never", "url": "https://x.com/talkaboutdesign/status/2113451214645932336"}, {"author_id": "1628114379958026240", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:58:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113449902940549236"], "id": "2113449902940549236", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 64, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 4, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "4 personal agents in 10 weeks, all with the same core (own cloud computer, works while you're away)\n\ngrok bot: \"AI teammates\"\nmeta muse: \"built for everyone\"\nopenai dots: \"built to handle everything\"\nclaude duet: \"professionals and small business owners\"\n\nanthropic shipped last", "url": "https://x.com/zhallen122/status/2113449902940549236"}, {"author_id": "16477982", "created_at": "2026-10-23T01:18:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113439784081473933"], "id": "2113439784081473933", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 3686, "like_count": 50, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 2}, "text": "I think $META Muse has a shot at becoming the most valuable advertising business in the world.\n\nAdvertising is ultimately driven by conversion rates. A billboard has low conversion because it's irrelevant for most people passing by. TV a bit higher because you've got some", "url": "https://x.com/thomasrice_au/status/2113439784081473933"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113412594514137088"]}, "author_id": "564497304", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:30:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113412598557483150"], "id": "2113412598557483150", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 89, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Claude Duet launched with Opus 5.5. Australia misses out.\n\nClaude finally entered the personal agent race with Duet, running on Opus 5.5, the top-ranked model on Arena’s agent leaderboard. But you can’t use it in Australia. It’s US only by waitlist.\n\nSo I compared Grok Bot, https://t.co/ou3MdpxZYA", "url": "https://x.com/himanshu_v92/status/2113412598557483150"}, {"article": {"title": "AI Top 14 for Oct 22: AI stocks sink, outsiders test OpenAI's agent monitor, 1Password for agents"}, "author_id": "6452362", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:21:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113380242412671359"], "id": "2113380242412671359", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 1296, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/R32HYA1sx8", "url": "https://x.com/MichaelGannotti/status/2113380242412671359"}, {"article": {"title": "00-个人智能体元年：一个词，好几种意思"}, "author_id": "1745332167218196480", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:20:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113380025059938775"], "id": "2113380025059938775", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 880, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/CG3TsMKg1g", "url": "https://x.com/sujingshen/status/2113380025059938775"}, {"article": {"title": "The Last Model You’ll Ever Need "}, "author_id": "1818720924763619328", "created_at": "2026-10-22T21:11:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113377609832960412"], "id": "2113377609832960412", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 449, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/CeNbevXA8u", "url": "https://x.com/yugosai/status/2113377609832960412"}, {"article": {"title": "InFlow Launches Discover, Onboard, and Pay to Run Your Entire Commerce Channel for AI Agents"}, "author_id": "1571609790748692481", "created_at": "2026-10-22T20:57:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113374274287452252"], "id": "2113374274287452252", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 280, "like_count": 4, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "https://t.co/astIWCjwzi", "url": "https://x.com/phongnguyendang/status/2113374274287452252"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2113536231933874176", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVTKAURWEAAwGGA.jpg"}, {"media_key": "3_2113412594514137088", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HVRZjq_aEAA2CX_.jpg"}], "users": [{"id": "2069660450929913856", "name": "Umer Daraz Khan", "username": "umerdarazkha"}, {"id": "1984808728206721024", "name": "Masato｜AIを現実につなぐ実験屋", "username": "masato_ai_log"}, {"id": "2037978275591438336", "name": "Benson Hedge", "username": "hedgeonai"}, {"id": "2018632049419030529", "name": "Automate With David", "username": "AutomateDavid"}, {"id": "1720665183188922368", "name": "Grok", "username": "grok"}, {"id": "2110726916131155969", "name": "ForwardPass Tech", "username": "ForwardPassTech"}, {"id": "1455908690817536009", "name": "KENJI｜業務設計・仕組化×AI", "username": "kenji_aisupport"}, {"id": "1745332167218196480", "name": "SagaSu", "username": "sujingshen"}, {"id": "1519152705150885890", "name": "Bad Latency", "username": "bad_latency"}, {"id": "2048636572267139072", "name": "ラッキー｜AIを武器に。", "username": "lucky_note_lab"}, {"id": "16414674", "name": "Max 🇺🇦", "username": "talkaboutdesign"}, {"id": "1628114379958026240", "name": "zhallen", "username": "zhallen122"}, {"id": "16477982", "name": "Thomas Rice", "username": "thomasrice_au"}, {"id": "564497304", "name": "Himanshu V", "username": "himanshu_v92"}, {"id": "6452362", "name": "Mike Gannotti 🔳", "username": "MichaelGannotti"}, {"id": "1818720924763619328", "name": "Yugos", "username": "yugosai"}, {"id": "1571609790748692481", "name": "Phong Nguyen Dang", "username": "phongnguyendang"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2113603503323296150", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzlwtp29zjji41ztiggk1k0hp27wd", "oldest_id": "2113374274287452252", "result_count": 18}}